WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.100
Jerusalem.

2
00:00:01.150 --> 00:00:03.610
The church is growing fast.

3
00:00:03.660 --> 00:00:05.800
Then a complaint breaks out.

4
00:00:05.850 --> 00:00:09.660
Greek-speaking believers say their widows
are being left out of the daily share

5
00:00:09.710 --> 00:00:10.670
of food.

6
00:00:10.720 --> 00:00:14.480
The apostles will not leave the
word of God to serve tables.

7
00:00:14.530 --> 00:00:16.600
So seven men are chosen.

8
00:00:16.650 --> 00:00:18.720
Every one has a Greek name.

9
00:00:18.770 --> 00:00:23.420
So why did two of these food servers
end up changing where the faith went?

10
00:00:23.470 --> 00:00:26.460
In this mission, you'll
follow Stephen into a debate,

11
00:00:26.510 --> 00:00:30.540
a trial before the Council,
and the longest speech in Acts.

12
00:00:30.590 --> 00:00:33.370
Then you'll weigh up three
ways scholars read it:

13
00:00:33.420 --> 00:00:36.420
a critique of the Temple,
a composition by Luke,

14
00:00:36.470 --> 00:00:38.520
or a real defence.

15
00:00:38.570 --> 00:00:43.080
Your mission: find out how two of the
Seven changed where the faith went.
